               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">NSR0240MX2 - Schottky Barrier Diode</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Schottky barrier diodes are optimized for very low forward voltage drop and low leakage current and are used in a wide range of dcâ€dc converter, clamping and protection applications in portable devices. NSR0240MX2 in the X2DFN2 miniature package enables designers to meet the challenging task of achieving higher efficiency and meeting reduced space requirements.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
